@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

state "Unassigned" as Unassigned
Unassigned : entry / Staff member is not assigned to any client or campaign
Unassigned : do / Assign staff member to a client or campaign
Unassigned : exit / Staff member is now assigned

state "Assigned" as Assigned
Assigned : entry / Staff member is currently assigned to a client or campaign
Assigned : do / Switch assignments during work period
Assigned : exit / Staff member is still assigned but to a different client or campaign

state "Unemployed" as Unemployed
Unemployed : entry / Staff member has left the job
Unemployed : exit / Record archived after some time has passed

state "Archived" as Archived
Archived : entry / Record of former employee is archived
Archived : exit / [*]

Assigned --> Unassigned : Remove assignment
Unassigned --> Assigned : Switch assignments
Unemployed --> Archived : Time elapsed after leaving the job
@enduml
